      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slippery_Rock%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town’s railroad history includes a depot on the Pittsburgh, Shenango and Lake Erie line, now part of Canadian National Railway.",
